[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0407","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0407.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0387","title":"FreeBSD golddig 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"FreeBSD Ports Collection 中的 golddig 游戏所包含的 makelev 程序存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击等方式，利用该程序在处理文件时未充分验证路径的缺陷，以游戏运行权限覆盖系统任意文件，导致本地数据完整性受损。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用，但需要本地用户权限。受影响系统为运行 golddig 游戏的 FreeBSD 系统。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0387"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-09T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36.613","remediation":"删除 golddig 游戏包中 makelev 程序的 setuid 位：`chmod u-s /usr/local/bin/makelev`；如非必要，直接卸载 golddig 包：`pkg_delete golddig` 或 `pkg remove golddig`。升级 FreeBSD ports 至包含修复的版本，或从 ports 中移除 golddig 游戏。限制本地非授权用户对 makelev 的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0387.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0387","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0387.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0387.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0b54eddb6b01c4a2bdae016ba668128b1a8b9336/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-4jg2-rc77-pvcj/GHSA-4jg2-rc77-pvcj.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0387.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001359.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--6238c6be-e443-4cf6-a380-65919bf8f8b7.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0407.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0401","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0401.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0383","title":"AOL Instant Messenger 文件传输路径泄露漏洞","description":"AOL Instant Messenger（AIM）的文件传输组件存在路径信息泄露漏洞。当用户通过 AIM 的文件传输功能发送文件时，系统会将发送方本地文件系统的完整物理路径暴露给接收方。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞获取目标系统的目录结构信息，为进一步攻击收集敏感信息。该漏洞影响 AOL Instant Messenger 的多个版本，攻击者只需诱导目标发送任意文件即可触发信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0383"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36.130","remediation":"AOL Instant Messenger 已于 2017 年 12 月 15 日正式停止服务，建议立即卸载 AIM 客户端并迁移至其他受支持的即时通讯软件（如 Slack、Microsoft Teams 等）。如因历史原因必须继续使用，可在 AIM 文件传输设置中禁用\"显示文件路径\"选项，并在防火墙规则中阻止 AIM 的 TCP 端口 5190 出站连接以限制文件传输功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1180","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=002401bfb918%247310d5a0%241ef084ce%40karemor.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0383.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0383","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0383.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0383.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0f14531dae9947fef349fa696ac83d6fc56f601e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-52fg-2wrh-pq8q/GHSA-52fg-2wrh-pq8q.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0383.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--57897d78-a338-46c3-a79a-5b94ba906271.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0401.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0398","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0398.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0382","title":"Allaire ClusterCATS URL重定向漏洞","description":"Allaire ClusterCATS 在处理 HTML 重定向时存在信息泄露漏洞，会将过期的查询字符串参数附加到重定向 URL 中，导致敏感信息（如会话令牌、认证凭据等）被泄露给第三方站点。攻击者可通过构造特制的重定向请求，诱使目标用户访问恶意站点，从而窃取 URL 中携带的敏感数据。该漏洞影响 ColdFusion ClusterCATS 相关版本，攻击复杂度较高，需用户交互配合，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0382"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36.003","remediation":"建议立即安装 Allaire 官方补丁（参考安全公告 ID 15697），该补丁修复了 ClusterCATS 在 HTML 重定向时附加过期查询字符串参数导致信息泄露的问题。由于 ColdFusion ClusterCATS 已停止维护，建议升级到受支持的 ColdFusion 版本，或在 Web 服务器层面对重定向 URL 进行参数过滤清理作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=15697&Method=Full","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1179","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0382.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0382","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0382.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0382.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4d465198ab8436491a7618e7789ef7adce4c01e0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jfh9-vp9v-wh4v/GHSA-jfh9-vp9v-wh4v.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0382.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Aries/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.898"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0398.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0318","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0318.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0384","title":"Intel NetStructure 7110 未记录账户密码漏洞","description":"Intel NetStructure 7110 和 7180 设备存在未记录的后门账户漏洞（servnow、root、wizard），其密码可通过设备的 MAC 地址推算得出。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，通过猜测密码以 root 权限登录设备，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 NetStructure 7110 及 7180 系列产品，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商未提供官方补丁，建议限制设备管理接口的网络访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0384"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36.250","remediation":"立即修改 Intel NetStructure 7110/7180 设备中 servnow、root、wizard 三个未记录账户的密码为强随机密码，避免使用与 MAC 地址相关的任何字符串；在防火墙上限制仅允许受信 IP 访问设备管理端口（Telnet/SSH/HTTP）；如业务允许，禁用未使用的 wizard 账户或将 shell 设为 /sbin/nologin；将设备置于隔离网段，避免暴露在公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://216.188.41.136/","http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/ipivot7180.html","http://www.lopht.com/advisories/ipivot7110.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1182","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1183","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19904","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0384.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0384.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0384","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0384.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0384.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/939814c958d14a0bcaf2639e41afe118cdb5f74c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-765g-qxmj-pjrx/GHSA-765g-qxmj-pjrx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1182/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7dec9782-ea7f-4bc5-b055-bb8934ad2691.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0318.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0341","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0341.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0413","title":"Microsoft IIS FrontPage 服务器扩展路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"IIS 4.0 和 5.0 的 FrontPage 服务器扩展组件中的 shtml.exe 程序存在物理路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过请求一个不存在的 HTML、HTM、ASP 或 SHTML 文件，触发服务器返回包含完整物理路径的错误信息，从而获取网站根目录的真实路径。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者获取路径信息后可为进一步探测和攻击提供基础。影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 上运行 IIS 4.0/5.0 并安装 FrontPage 服务器扩展的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0413"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-06T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39.827","remediation":"建议立即卸载或禁用 FrontPage 服务器扩展（FrontPage Server Extensions），或升级至 Windows 2000 SP2 及以上版本。如业务必须使用，应在 IIS 管理器中为 shtml.exe 配置自定义错误页面，禁止返回详细路径信息；同时限制 shtml.exe 仅允许本地或受信 IP 访问。临时缓解措施可在 Web 服务器上配置 URLScan 工具拦截对 shtml.exe 的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0084.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1174","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19897","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0413.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0413.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0413","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0413.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0413.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/frontpage_shtml.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jx68-8j6j-8v87/GHSA-jx68-8j6j-8v87.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0413.yaml","https://github.com/ivanitlearning/CTF-Repos/blob/b5364388a861fc7457409d494a9d075d73e7867e/Vulnhub/SkyTower/Web-scan.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0413.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0341.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0341.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0341.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0348","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0348.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0426","title":"UltraScripts UltraBoard 1.6 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"UltraScripts UltraBoard 1.6 及其他版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在 Session 参数中引用 UltraBoard，导致 UltraBoard 进程不断 fork 出自身副本，耗尽系统进程资源，从而导致拒绝服务。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，仅需构造包含 UltraBoard 引用的 Session 参数发送请求即可触发漏洞，导致服务器资源耗尽、服务不可用。该漏洞影响 UltraBoard 1.6 及其他版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害），主要影响系统可用性。UltraScripts 官方已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0426"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-05T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42.443","remediation":"建议立即升级 UltraBoard 1.6 到 1.8 或更高版本以获取 Session 参数验证补丁。如无法立即打补丁，请使用防火墙对管理端口进行源 IP 限制，有效降低程序异常的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0059.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1175","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19899","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0426.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0426","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0426.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0426.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6fq7-3q96-vw9x/GHSA-6fq7-3q96-vw9x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735