E-2000-0428","title":"趋势科技 InterScan Virus Wall SMTP 网关缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 3.32 及更早版本的 SMTP 网关存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送包含超长文件名的 uuencode 编码附件触发缓冲区溢出，无需身份认证即可在目标系统上以系统权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 InterScan VirusWall 3.32 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 10.0（CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H），属于严重级别。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，通过构造超长文件名的 uuencode 附件发送至目标 SMTP 网关即可触发缓冲区溢出并执行任意代码，Trend Micro 已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0428"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42.710","remediation":"立即升级至 Trend Micro InterScan Virus Wall 3.33 或更高版本（官方已发布修补补丁）。如无法立即升级，请在防火墙层面封锁 SMTP 端口（25/587）仅允许受信邮件服务器访问、限制邮件附件大小上限至 10MB 以下、在邮件网关启用附件类型过滤拦截 uuencode 编码附件、部署 IPS 规则拦截超长文件名 payload、联系 Trend Micro 技术支持获取官方补丁包及部署指导文档。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.nai.com/nai_labs/asp_set/advisory/39_Trend.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1168","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0428.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0428.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0428","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0428.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0428.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wc7h-rjv2-pvjh/GHSA-wc7h-rjv2-pvjh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0428.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0428.md","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0456","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0456.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0422","title":"Netwin DMailWeb CGI 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Netwin DMailWeb CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 utoken 参数提交超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标服务器上以 CGI 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Netwin DMailWeb 相关版本，攻击无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0422"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:41.950","remediation":"立即升级 Netwin DMailWeb CGI 程序至 2.5e 或更高版本，可从 ftp://ftp.netwinsite.com/pub/dmailweb/beta/ 获取。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面限制对 dmailweb/dmailweb.exe 的访问，或对 utoken 参数长度进行输入校验（限制不超过 256 字符）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95749276827558&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1171","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0422.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0422","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0422.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0422.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h7mr-chr8-q245/GHSA-h7mr-chr8-q245.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0422.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1171/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/b12a3924bcdfa7af53ab2da329173ee04bf863bc/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0456.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0446","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0446.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0414","title":"HP HP-UX shutdown 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.X 及 10.X 系统中的 shutdown 命令存在本地权限提升漏洞，由于该命令在处理用户提供的畸形输入变量时未进行充分的边界检查与过滤，导致攻击者可通过精心构造的环境变量或命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出或参数注入。本地攻击者只需拥有系统普通用户权限即可利用该漏洞，成功利用后可获取 root 权限，完全控制目标系统，造成机密性、完整性和可用性受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0414"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39.947","remediation":"建议升级至 HP-UX 11i v3 (11.31) 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。对于仍运行 HP-UX 10.X/11.0/11.11 的系统，作为临时缓解措施，可限制 shutdown 命令的执行权限，仅允许 root 用户执行：`chmod 700 /sbin/shutdown`，并监控 `/var/adm/syslog` 中异常的 shutdown 调用记录。HP 已停止对 10.X 和 11.0 的安全支持，建议尽快迁移至受支持版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0047.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1214","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0414.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0414","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0414.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0414.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-46x7-g574-2w2v/GHSA-46x7-g574-2w2v.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0414.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001348.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2f1f2968-6301-4668-93a2-4a7892409d4d.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0446.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0350","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0350.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0427","title":"Aladdin Knowledge Systems eToken PIN 提取漏洞","description":"Aladdin Knowledge Systems eToken 3.3.3 设备存在 PIN 提取漏洞。攻击者仅需物理接触设备，即可通过修改 EEPROM 中的数据重置目标设备的 PIN 码，从而绕过 PIN 保护机制，非法获取设备存储的所有敏感信息，包括信用卡 PIN、密码等机密数据。该漏洞利用设备内部PIN存储机制的缺陷，攻击者无需得知原始PIN即可访问全部机密信息，严重威胁了用户的身份认证安全。该设备支持多种金融认证应用，广泛应用于银行、支付系统等领域，漏洞影响范围涵盖所有使用该型号设备的用户。攻击条件为：攻击者必须具备对设备的物理接触权限，可随时执行PIN提取操作。该漏洞CVSS评分4.6，安全等级中低，表明其影响虽有限，但一旦被利用，将导致严重数据泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0427"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42.583","remediation":"建议立即更换为Aladdin eToken 4.0及以上版本或厂商最新硬件令牌，启用防篡改物理外壳与密封标签防止物理接触攻击，配合双因子认证（PIN+生物识别）作为额外防护层，并定期审计设备物理完整性与固件完整性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/etoken-piepa.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/3266","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1170","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19894","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0427.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0427.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0427","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0427.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0427.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3hmx-5jq6-252x/GHSA-3hmx-5jq6-252x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0427.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001350.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0350.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0353","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0430","title":"Cart32 Cart32 3.0 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cart32 3.0 购物车软件存在管理信息泄露漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可通过在 URL 请求中追加 \"/expdate\" 路径，直接访问敏感的调试和管理调试信息。该漏洞源于 Cart32 3.0 未对特定调试端点进行访问控制，导致敏感管理信息泄露。攻击条件为远程网络访问、低攻击复杂度、无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），影响机密性部分丧失，不影响完整性和可用性。攻击者可利用该漏洞获取系统调试信息，辅助进一步攻击。影响范围为 Cart32 3.0 版本购物车软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0430"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42.967","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Cart32 3.0 之后的最新版本（官方已停止维护 3.0 版本），或迁移至现代电商平台（如 Shopify、Magento、WooCommerce 等）。若暂时无法升级，请在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面配置 URL 重写规则，拦截所有包含 `/expdate` 路径的请求，并限制管理后台仅允许受信 IP 访问。建议同时在 WAF 层面添加规则拦截包含 `expdate` 路径的请求，并审计服务器日志排查是否已被利用泄露调试信息。建议尽快完成电商系统迁移，彻底淘汰不再维护的 Cart32 3.0 组件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95738697301956&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1358","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20019","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0430.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0430","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0430.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0430.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-27gf-ff72-jfqr/GHSA-27gf-ff72-jfqr.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0430.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--efd046f1-024d-4bf2-9072-81c8e0adf4b5.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0353.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0353.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0349","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0349.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0345","title":"Cisco IOS 路由器在线帮助系统信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cisco 路由器在线帮助系统存在信息泄露漏洞。低权限（非 enable 模式）的本地攻击者可通过在 CLI 界面中执行 show 命令，利用帮助系统选项获取敏感配置信息。该漏洞影响 Cisco 2500/2600/3600/4000/7200/7500 系列路由器及 IOS 系统，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。攻击者需已获得本地访问权限方可利用，无法远程触发。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0345"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31.413","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至不受影响版本（如 12.0(5) 及以上），或通过全局配置模式使用 `no service help` 命令禁用在线帮助系统。同时配置 privilege 级别限制，将 `show` 命令的访问权限绑定至 privilege level 15，防止低权限用户通过 `show` 命令获取敏感配置信息。如无法立即升级，可在 line vty 下配置 `privilege level 15` 限制非授权用户访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1161","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000502222246.28423.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0345.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0345","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0345.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c652-vf4r-c57r/GHSA-c652-vf4r-c57r.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0345.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4bfaecb4-0e8f-4414-a9a8-523f28f28202.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0345.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1161/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0349.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0346","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0346.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0425","title":"L-Soft LISTSERV 1.8 Web Archives 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"L-Soft LISTSERV 1.8 Web Archives 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 Web Archives 组件发送特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，进而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 L-Soft LISTSERV 1.8 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、机密性/完整性/可用性影响均为完全。攻击者可通过构造恶意 HTTP 请求触发缓冲区溢出，实现远程代码执行，完全控制目标服务器。ExploitDB 已公开相关利用代码（EDB-19893）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0425"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42.320","remediation":"立即升级 L-Soft Listserv 至 1.8d 或更高版本（官方已在 2000 年 5 月发布修复补丁）。若无法立即升级，请在 Web 服务器或防火墙层面禁用 Listserv Web Archives 组件（通常为 /archives/ 或 /wa/ 路径），或在防火墙层面限制对 Listserv Web 管理端口（默认 80/443）的访问仅限可信管理 IP。同时建议在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面部署针对缓冲区溢出特征的防护规则，并限制 Listserv 服务进程权限以最小权限运行。立即升级至官方最新版本为最彻底修复方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0048.html","http://www.lsoft.com/news/default.asp?item=Advisory0","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1167","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19893","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0425.json","https:/